# 统一换行符：仓库内一律 LF，避免 Windows/macOS 协作时产生无意义的整文件 diff
* text=auto eol=lf

# 二进制文件不做换行转换
*.png  binary
*.jpg  binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif  binary
*.ico  binary
*.icns binary
*.db   binary
*.exe  binary
*.dll  binary
*.node binary

# 这些文件必须是 LF，否则在 Linux/macOS 上执行会报错
*.sh   text eol=lf
*.mjs  text eol=lf
*.cjs  text eol=lf

# GitHub 语言统计：把生成物与文档排除在外
docs/**      linguist-documentation
*.md         linguist-documentation
pnpm-lock.yaml linguist-generated
